brow">New York programme</div><h2>Three days. One defining moment.</h2><div class="programme"><article class="day"><h3>6 October · Arrival</h3><p>Delegation arrivals, organised transfers, hotel check-in, accreditation, editorial and logistics briefing, and the official welcome gala.</p></article><article class="day"><h3>7 October · Activation</h3><p>Security and media set-up, background session, THE CODE central activation at 11:30 a.m. ET, press Q&amp;A, working lunch, executive forum and interviews.</p></article><article class="day"><h3>8 October · Closing</h3><p>Final interviews, fact-checking, digital and physical press packages, courtesy package and organised airport transfers.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section white"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Travel and logistics</div><h2>Approved programme cost: EUR 0.00.</h2><p class="lead">For an officially approved media organisation, the organiser covers approved return flights, hotel accommodation for the approved period, official local transfers, accreditation, official functions, press materials, interviews and fact-checking.</p><p>Personal expenses, independent upgrades, unapproved itinerary changes, additional private transfers and extensions of stay are not included without written approval.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Automated registration</div><h2>What to click — in this order.</h2><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="num">1</div><div><b>Register the newsroom</b><br>Enter the official media organisation details and official newsroom email. The secure system issues a unique invitation reference and personal access code.</div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">2</div><div><b>Open THE CODE</b><br>Review the project overview, international context and New York programme.</div></div><div class="step"><div class="num">3</div><div><b>Open the official memorandum</b><br>Access the designed 12-page PDF memorandum and the formal media information.</div></div></div><div class="notice"><strong>Personal data security:</strong> passport copies and identity documents must not be sent by ordinary email. A secure documentation channel is opened only after conditional approval.</div><div class="actions"><a class="btn gold" href="/media-application/?lang=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">REGISTER NEWSROOM</a><a class="btn" style="color:#081a33;border-color:#081a33" href="/the-code/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OPEN THE CODE</a><a class="btn light" style="border-color:#9a6d20" href="/api/media-registration/memorandum.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OPEN MEMORANDUM</a></div><div class="testbar"><b>Interactive link test:</b> all three buttons open separate official destinations, allowing visitors to test registration, the presentation and the memorandum independently.</div></div></section>
</main>
